New
- Next track and Previous track actions, so a gesture can skip what you are listening to.
- A Diagnostics screen showing the last crash, with a button that opens a prefilled GitHub issue. Crash reports stay on your device unless you share them.

Fixed
- A crash when cycling the ringer while the phone was already silent.
- A crash in the action picker caused by an installed app with an oversized icon.
- Added a shortcut to the Do Not Disturb access screen, which silent mode requires.
